+/// witnesses for the generated companion dictionary type of the document
+/// fixture: the generated companion type is a typed dictionary like any
+/// other, constructible from a plain dictionary, which is exactly the
+/// construction this class provides. The registered names under which the
+/// generated artifacts declare their supported types live in the
+/// [AdapterManifest]; the emitted instances only need to expose the queried
+/// data of the underlying dictionary.
+final class GeneratedResultDictionary
+    implements TypedDictionaryObject<GeneratedResultDictionary> {
