+/**
+ * Documents the JUnit 5 tags used to route Java-analysis-flavor-specific tests.
+ *
+ * `utils.OnlyJavaPsi` marks tests that are valid only under PSI-based (K1) Java analysis,
+ * while `utils.OnlyJavaSymbols` marks tests that are valid only under symbol-based (K2)
+ * Java analysis. Each of these tests must run exclusively under its compatible Java
+ * analysis target so that the K1 (descriptor/PSI) and K2 (symbol) Java test targets do
+ * not attempt to run, and fail, each other's analysis-specific cases. The Gradle test
+ * targets consult these tags through their `useJUnitPlatform` include/exclude tag
+ * configuration when selecting which tests to execute.
